# Workspace paths discover.sh should not scan at all -- projects considered
# out of scope for this sync (not because their base images are self-built,
# but because the project itself isn't something we're syncing dependencies
# for). One path fragment per line, matched against the full file path
# (see discover.sh's use of `find ... -not -path`).
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# This is a template: `config/ignore-paths.txt` (the file discover.sh
# actually reads) is gitignored since it names internal project directories
# and tends to get tweaked per checkout. Copy this file there and edit
# freely -- your local copy won't show up as a diff.

*/newshub_workspace/newshub/*
*/newsgrab/*
*/stock_workspace/daily_stock_analysis/*
